01:01:20,000 --> 01:01:26,000
Bob Ross: Happy Accidents, Betrayal & Greed is a 2021 American biographical documentary
film produced and distributed by Netflix and directed by Joshua Rofé.

11
01:07:28,000 --> 01:07:34,000
The film offers a look into the life and career of painter and television
host Bob Ross, and the battle for his business empire.

12
01:13:36,000 --> 01:13:42,000
The film was released on August 25, 2021.

13
01:19:44,000 --> 01:19:50,000
The film explores themes of artist, painter, lawsuit, business ethics, cancer.

14
01:25:52,000 --> 01:25:58,000
The tone is thought_provoking.
